}
Towards evening the mist thickened along the farmyard fences and came to a halt. It did not stir, though the wind tugged at the thatches. The Candlemas candles that had gone out on the way back from the churchyard would not light again—the wicks hissed and blackened.
{ not marysia_odzyskana:
    Only Hanka’s Candlemas candle burned on the table, steadily, just as it had the day before. # pokaz: gromnica_hanki
}
Jaromir sat down on the threshold. He leaned {zastaw_u_leszego == zastaw_siekiera:his father-in-law’s|his grandfather’s} axe against the doorpost, the haft close to his hand.{ ekwipunek ? krzesiwo: In his pocket he could feel the chill of the flint and steel.} He waited. # pokaz: prog # dalej
