        That one, in the little white shift, did not go in after them. The Lord of the Forest looked back at her from the edge of the forest.
        “She was with me too long. Her home she remembers now only as in a dream,” he said. “I will not give her back to you alive. But she is mine no longer.”
        { ekwipunek ? wstazka_marysi:
            Jaromir went up to her, unwound the faded ribbon from his wrist and tied it in a bow in her hair, the way Hanka used to.
